 "description": "string quartet evening: Fauré, Smetana, Beethoven Rasumovsky",
 "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T18:50:55.988Z",
 "details": "\"Musik aus der Stille\" is the first chamber concert (series \"So um 5\") of the Deutsche Staatsphilharmonie in its own house, the Philharmonie Ludwigshafen, on Totensonntag. A string quartet of orchestra members (Anikó Szathmáry, Kyrill Tkachenko, Paul Werba, Giulia Trevisano) plays Fauré's String Quartet in E minor op. 121, Smetana's Quartet No. 1 \"From my life\" and Beethoven's Rasumovsky Quartet op. 59 No. 2.\n\nSunday 17:00. Tickets from 18 EUR (mvp.de).",
